     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    10'disclose or share personal -
     A                                      medical information as -
     A                                      permitted by law; for -
     A                                      example, in order to -
     A                                      underwrite policies or'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20000 T1V10037)
